#: (paragraph)
#, md-text
msgid ""
"The full unparsed parameters for the running macro can be access via the "
"`rawparams` pseudo-variable."
msgstr ""
"De fullständiga otolkade parametrarna för makrot som körs nås via "
"pseudovariabeln `rawparams`."

#: docs/Command_Templates.md:block
#: 12
#: (paragraph)
#, md-text
msgid ""
"The terminal will display the description when you use the `HELP` command or "
"the autocomplete function."
msgstr ""
"Terminalen visar beskrivningen när du använder kommandot `HELP` eller "
"funktionen för automatisk komplettering."

#: docs/Command_Templates.md:block
#: 30
#: (paragraph)
#, md-text
msgid ""
"Note that this will include any comments that were part of the original "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Observera att detta inkluderar kommentarer som var del av det ursprungliga "
"kommandot."

#: docs/Command_Templates.md:block
#: 31
#: (paragraph)
#, md-text
msgid ""
"See the [sample-macros.cfg](../config/sample-macros.cfg) file for an example "
"showing how to override the `M117` command using `rawparams`."
msgstr ""
"Se filen [sample-macros.cfg](../config/sample-macros.cfg) för ett exempel på "
"hur kommandot `M117` åsidosätts med `rawparams`."
